OL,3,APolice Scotland carrying out 'active
OL,4,Ainquiries' into Andrew and Epstein
OL,5,ABalmoral visits
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice Scotland is making inquiries
OL,8,Finto the activities of Andrew
OL,9,FMountbatten-Windsor, Jeffrey Epstein
OL,10,Fand Ghislane Maxwell during their time
OL,11,Fat Balmoral Castle.
OL,13,FThe Daily Express reported that the
OL,14,Finquiry relates to allegations that
OL,15,Fwomen were trafficked to the royal
OL,16,Fresidence in Aberdeenshire.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
