OL,3,ASpain transport minister says he won't
OL,4,Aresign over high-speed rail disaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpain's transport minister says he
OL,7,Fwon't resign over the high-speed rail
OL,8,Fcollision that has left at least 69
OL,9,Fpeople dead.
OL,11,FOscar Puente told a news conference in
OL,12,FMadrid he had "nothing to hide" while
OL,13,Frepeating the government's vow to get
OL,14,Fto the bottom of the disaster, saying
OL,15,Fmany questions needed to be answered.
OL,17,F"My duty right now is not to talk about
OL,18,Fwhether I should remain in my position,
OL,19,Fbut to resolve the problem," Puente
OL,20,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
